WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.606
Freshness policy is part of the data product
Consumers need to know

00:00:05.619 --> 00:00:11.352
how often the materialized view refreshes They need
a way to see the last

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:17.069
successful refresh The team should know what happens
when refresh fails

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:23.122
And the expected maximum latency should be
documented rather than assumed
